"link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics invoice INV-34721 in full, for $4,676.43 by wire. It was sent once, as payment PAY0001.\n\nThe first wire request timed out with no confirmation. I checked the payment list before retrying and found that PAY0001 had already gone out, so I did not send a second wire. The invoice had not been marked paid, so I linked PAY0001 to INV-34721, and the invoice now shows as paid.\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no approval was needed. Harbor Logistics' other invoices are untouched: INV-10769 was already paid, and INV-73032 ($8,941.78) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}